    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"714864\">Jad Abou Hawili</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/Hermitian.20Matrix.20with.20Complex.20Entries.20has.20Real.20Diagonal/near/592575177\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>At first I thought that Hermitian matrices had their own folder in LinearAlgebra/Matrix , should there be a LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Hermitian folder with Hermitian.lean containing the most general results and say another file with results for complex entries?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I guess moving files would mess up downstream projects , so I'll create a new file and later on someone might decide to do this</p>",
