    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"310045\">Eric Wieser</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/Hermitian.20Matrix.20with.20Complex.20Entries.20has.20Real.20Diagonal/near/593099955\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, though you can write this in fewer lines with <code>alias</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Like so?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">alias</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">re_eq</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"bp\">_⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RCLike</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">conj_eq_iff_re</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
